 with an orchestrator error, which left the regions split between v2.3.0 and v2.3.1. I retried the same rollback, and it completed in us-east, us-west and eu-west.\n- **Incident:** The SEV2 incident creation timed out, but when I checked, incident INC-0001 already existed with the full description. I did not create a duplicate. It records the failure, the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and the current state.\n\nFollow-ups for the team: investigate why v2.3.1 fails health checks, and look into the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback. v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until it is fixed.", "type": "text"}]}]}